<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-21T18:48:20.119Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-affiliated militants killed at least 48 civilians in eastern Mali, while separate gunmen attacks in Mali killed over 40 civilians. In Niger, gunmen assaulted a bus, killing at least 11 passengers. Burkina Faso’s military junta reinstated the death penalty as it confronts an escalating jihadist insurgency. The war across Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPRDhKTTlnTVFYd3l3M3VlTHNiMXNwNE9GdkRBeGg1ZXk2eUVnRUl2c3V3Z1ZrZTk2djJLeGhIb3A1NlpTeWs2UWFtYkdhLXJjUS1aTVBfcHE2eGFwR21YdDhBOTlUVXpyb3pnX0xGRkpXaDNCM2c2LTJsNDVlaXFDUy14SWItaW5jOVBabDZZMF82em5oN2hHaFU4Vm90Tm5oVGV4ZVUzUkxLc0l0b2xTVUphUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9vaEJrOUdvN182ZV9nWkNVSVczaUczTVF2MHU2V0o1NGJlSnBEamxNek5wNXdYOXVLUUt5elFVcDI5TV9uRDBKeFdIeGdyWWR5eEhlLXpITndIOEREZlM5QnpDc3FCWm1qeTNUZDd1SFJKcFVOYk5HYUUyYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Human Rights Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOLVo3VHpYRTFtMkhuSGNHREZ2eUhEblRMTFV2VnMyblpqMHktOXhMWUt3Vl84czAyT0l1ei1oUTV3MnRQbS16eWZrLU9aem5kVmtvLThqNk9sdUVaSHlXMll2Mkhtbmx4SkRsemNCRFBVSG9HZmVoa01tZ2RraVlwdkViOVFxQU1IYW9EeTdHRFNRMW5MSWxhcVZGWHlzWjFFTGNTMEtXVzFNaHR4cW54NmIteHJnU2tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxONnRSTkhubldTTlVKVkFVcHRadmo4VDBhZDlOekRpQ2JUUzBVV2F1amhCUkhhckR0blg4VTdHczNMeTMxaXdoVjF5b2lXdlJrR1hkOXNjQmdvRUlYZVJ3NFhQYmxMSHItYTV0cVRJeXZtbVZHQkUtUmlCRWVyTzJHdHh0R2RxNXBfakI5R1c3NUdvUlNJT1EyZzdLVmNhWFpVUDRpd3RWeFBNU0RDNUlMbTZxSy05e